WEBVTT

00:06.971 --> 00:08.199
I have to stop him.

00:09.407 --> 00:11.307
I have to do everything I can
to stop him.

00:14.412 --> 00:15.379
Kashin...

00:20.985 --> 00:23.249
Where are you taking me,
Kashin?

00:23.388 --> 00:25.549
Don't worry about it.
Just follow me.

00:26.224 --> 00:27.020
This way!

00:27.392 --> 00:29.485
What's here, anyway?

00:30.361 --> 00:31.350
You want to know?

00:31.930 --> 00:32.897
Uh, yeah.

00:36.034 --> 00:36.898
What's that?

00:38.236 --> 00:39.203
A dream.

00:39.938 --> 00:40.870
Dream?

00:40.939 --> 00:42.201
It's my...

00:42.574 --> 00:44.599
I mean, our dream.

00:46.811 --> 00:48.073
Surprised?

00:48.947 --> 00:52.075
A little real estate
left behind by the scientists.

00:52.450 --> 00:54.042
I want to change the Underground...

00:54.119 --> 00:57.282
...with the help of those
who possess powers...

00:57.355 --> 01:02.588
...and turn it into a place where
everyone can live peacefully.

01:03.261 --> 01:06.822
A quiet, tranquil place
where there is no fighting.

01:07.465 --> 01:10.696
We're going to change this world...

01:10.769 --> 01:13.203
...a land of hopelessness and
sorrow, into a world of light!

01:14.305 --> 01:18.105
We will create an ideal world
which was denied to us...

01:18.176 --> 01:19.768
...by those on the surface.

01:19.844 --> 01:21.334
Chelsea Rorec...

01:22.714 --> 01:23.976
Teil Ashford...

01:25.283 --> 01:26.750
Suijen...

01:27.919 --> 01:29.910
And you, Seki.

01:33.324 --> 01:36.020
I want you all to help me!

01:37.028 --> 01:39.428
That was the beginning
of the Company.

01:41.933 --> 01:43.901
The passion of those times...

01:44.269 --> 01:45.759
The dream of those times...

01:47.438 --> 01:50.430
Have you really forgotten all that...

01:52.076 --> 01:52.974
...Kashin?

02:20.271 --> 02:25.732
HEY YOU!
If you keep sulking and
watch the world go by

02:26.477 --> 02:31.312
Nothing will ever happen
So don't run away

02:31.916 --> 02:38.048
If you have a future
that you can run to

02:38.122 --> 02:44.186
There's no time to be depressed

02:44.262 --> 02:50.531
Everyone gets lost
from time to time

02:50.602 --> 02:56.472
But we keep living
every day that we are granted

02:56.541 --> 03:02.673
Things that we must not lose

03:02.747 --> 03:08.777
We must protect
even if we get hurt

03:08.853 --> 03:15.019
Still we can believe
in our strength

03:15.093 --> 03:21.760
To be able to get up
and walk again

03:32.076 --> 03:33.839
People of the slums...

03:33.912 --> 03:37.575
...I am Kashin,
ruler of the Underground.

03:38.116 --> 03:40.141
That's Kashin?!

03:41.252 --> 03:43.345
I thought he'd be a lot tougher-looking.

03:44.155 --> 03:47.056
What are you going to do,
Kashin?

03:47.792 --> 03:52.092
You criminals harbor
ill intent against the Company...

03:52.563 --> 03:57.865
...thus you would have been deemed
rebels and simply locked away in prison.

03:58.202 --> 04:01.365
But out of benevolence and
a deep sense of compassion...

04:01.439 --> 04:04.499
...I created a place where you could
live freely under my protection.

04:05.009 --> 04:06.442
Don't interrupt!

04:06.511 --> 04:07.341
Cut the crap!

04:08.346 --> 04:09.335
Lord Kashin...

04:09.847 --> 04:12.680
So that's number one guy
in the Company?

04:12.884 --> 04:14.374
What's he talking about?

04:14.619 --> 04:16.553
What benevolence
and compassion?

04:16.721 --> 04:20.122
However,
my decision was wrong.

04:22.093 --> 04:22.821
Pairon?!

04:23.227 --> 04:25.457
Criminals of the slums...

04:25.530 --> 04:29.523
...I have learned
that you have been harboring...

04:29.600 --> 04:34.697
...Chelsea Rorec, who kidnapped
the Maiden of Life, as well as...

04:34.772 --> 04:37.366
...Rumina Asagi, the
intruder from the surface...

04:37.442 --> 04:39.171
...who together have been...

04:39.243 --> 04:43.145
...plotting to undermine
the authority of the Company.

04:43.514 --> 04:48.178
If you have any sense of loyalty
remaining toward the Company...

04:48.953 --> 04:51.012
...bring those two before me.

04:51.889 --> 04:54.790
Of course, I don't care
if they are dead or alive.

04:55.326 --> 04:57.988
So that's how the Company
does things.

04:58.262 --> 05:00.856
This is typical of the way
the Company operates.

05:01.165 --> 05:04.532
I will give you 10 minutes
to hand them over to me.

05:04.602 --> 05:09.130
If you do not oblige,
I will destroy the Killing Fields.

05:09.974 --> 05:10.838
Wh-What?!

05:11.042 --> 05:12.873
We'll end up getting killed?

05:13.211 --> 05:16.806
I will be waiting on the top floor
of this building.

05:17.248 --> 05:18.977
That's all I have to say.

05:24.822 --> 05:26.119
That's it, huh?

05:26.758 --> 05:28.385
Ruri's up there.

05:28.626 --> 05:32.323
Don't be stupid!
We'll go there ourselves!

05:32.397 --> 05:35.366
You fool.
They can't hear us!

05:38.469 --> 05:40.960
Rumina! Chelsea! Run!

05:41.539 --> 05:42.335
Ruri...!

05:46.911 --> 05:47.969
It's them!

05:48.346 --> 05:50.940
The traitor and the intruder
from the surface!

05:51.015 --> 05:52.744
Get them and
send them to the Company!

05:53.184 --> 05:55.175
Wh-Why is this happening?

05:55.253 --> 05:58.381
What could've happened
to Lord Kashin?

05:58.456 --> 06:01.482
Damn!
I'm getting tired of your naiveté!

06:01.559 --> 06:02.116
Huh?

06:02.927 --> 06:04.258
To Kashin...

06:04.328 --> 06:08.321
...the slums, the soldiers, and even
master warriors are expendable.

06:08.900 --> 06:11.926
If we're of no use to him,
he'll just get rid of us.

06:23.114 --> 06:24.877
People! Don't you move!

06:26.717 --> 06:28.742
This is called a power gun.

06:28.820 --> 06:30.651
It is a very dangerous weapon.

06:30.822 --> 06:33.313
Ginnosuke! You're alive!

06:33.658 --> 06:34.955
Oh, Rumina!

06:35.226 --> 06:36.784
I've been looking for you!

06:36.928 --> 06:41.297
Are you the Wind User Ginnosuke
has told me so much about?

06:42.233 --> 06:45.202
I see. You've got sharp eyes.

06:45.603 --> 06:49.562
This isn't the time to be
having a friendly chat, Sui.

06:49.640 --> 06:51.369
Chelsea Rorec...

06:51.843 --> 06:56.177
You did betray the Company.
I don't completely trust you yet.

06:56.247 --> 06:57.714
Huh? Do you know each other?

06:58.116 --> 06:59.947
When I was at the Company...

07:00.017 --> 07:02.383
...he'd try to come after me with
little gadgets he'd invented.

07:02.453 --> 07:04.751
I brushed him off every time.

07:05.223 --> 07:08.249
Don't talk about me
like I'm not here.

07:08.326 --> 07:11.124
What tricks do you have
up your sleeve today?

07:11.195 --> 07:12.162
Who knows?

07:13.364 --> 07:15.264
Just a whim.

07:15.700 --> 07:17.361
Let's get them all together!

07:17.435 --> 07:19.403
With all of us, we can get them!

07:24.475 --> 07:26.170
Lightning Shield!

07:30.114 --> 07:31.775
Everyone, listen to me!

07:31.916 --> 07:33.110
Hey...

07:33.284 --> 07:36.151
I'm sure you know all too well...

07:36.220 --> 07:38.017
...that it's the Company's fault!

07:38.489 --> 07:42.016
The Company is sent here,
thinking it can get away with this...

07:42.093 --> 07:46.223
...just like those who locked us up in
the Underground in the first place!

07:47.031 --> 07:49.591
The Company is hoping
to use the Maiden of Life...

07:49.667 --> 07:51.999
...as a way to get revenge
against the surface world.

07:52.370 --> 07:54.031
In other words, the Company...

07:54.105 --> 07:58.007
...is using you to do the dirty work
because it's convenient for them.

07:58.376 --> 08:00.844
Rather than turn these people
in to the Company...

08:00.912 --> 08:04.746
...we would be much better off
if we all went after the Company.

08:05.082 --> 08:06.014
Shut up!

08:06.083 --> 08:09.052
If we don't turn them in right now,
this place is going to collapse!

08:09.120 --> 08:09.984
That's right!

08:10.454 --> 08:11.921
I won't let him do that!

08:11.989 --> 08:14.287
I will defeat Kashin and Pairon!

08:14.358 --> 08:16.326
And I'm going to get Ruri back!

08:16.394 --> 08:18.885
There's no way, you little punk!

08:28.539 --> 08:30.632
Spinning Yo-yo!

08:35.079 --> 08:37.070
Don't push it too much, Shiel!

08:37.281 --> 08:38.179
Korin.

08:39.517 --> 08:41.917
We're from the Company
Youth Wing.

08:41.986 --> 08:43.248
We help each other!

08:44.989 --> 08:46.650
Now, this is your chance.

08:46.724 --> 08:47.281
Right!

08:47.558 --> 08:49.651
You leave this one to us.

08:49.760 --> 08:50.624
Shalma...

08:51.562 --> 08:53.587
But don't you die, alright?

08:53.998 --> 08:56.933
I do still have to defeat you.

08:57.668 --> 08:58.828
All right.

08:59.203 --> 09:02.570
Rumina!
Make sure you rescue the Maiden!

09:02.640 --> 09:03.800
Leave it to me!

09:09.013 --> 09:09.877
Now!

09:10.848 --> 09:11.837
Let's go!

09:17.822 --> 09:20.382
What was that, Sarasa?

09:21.192 --> 09:25.288
Is this what you meant when
you said I could see Rumina?

09:31.135 --> 09:32.466
Sarasa...

09:32.903 --> 09:34.234
Please.

09:34.538 --> 09:37.530
Do not hurt Chelsea or Rumina.

09:38.109 --> 09:41.806
Sarasa, there's no reason
for you to suffer.

09:42.280 --> 09:45.807
I will be sure to protect you.

09:48.686 --> 09:51.052
I hope you understand, Sarasa.

09:52.757 --> 09:55.055
Rumina once told me that...

09:57.228 --> 10:02.222
...he would blow away my tears
and sorrows with his wind.

10:04.235 --> 10:08.399
And Chelsea said,
"I will protect you, Ruri."

10:09.140 --> 10:11.608
Shiel and Ginnosuke...

10:12.843 --> 10:15.141
Everyone is doing this for me.

10:15.746 --> 10:17.338
All for me.

10:19.884 --> 10:22.717
Ruri, you hang on!
I'm on my way!

10:23.788 --> 10:24.812
Ruri...

10:25.656 --> 10:28.921
All those people
are very important to me.

10:29.560 --> 10:31.221
Please don't hurt them.

10:31.295 --> 10:32.159
No.

10:33.431 --> 10:36.832
As long as your attention
is directed towards them...

10:36.901 --> 10:39.563
...you won't turn to me.

10:40.538 --> 10:43.132
As long as those people exist
in this world...

10:43.808 --> 10:46.402
...you will never come back to me.

10:52.350 --> 10:53.442
Kashin...

10:53.517 --> 10:55.144
Please kill me, Kashin.

10:55.219 --> 10:56.811
No! No!

10:56.987 --> 10:58.921
No way!

11:00.658 --> 11:04.492
I will never again make you
feel sad, sis.

11:06.163 --> 11:10.566
I will annihilate them
here in the Underground.

11:17.475 --> 11:18.237
I...

11:20.911 --> 11:24.711
I cannot be the maiden
you want me to be.

11:26.050 --> 11:26.846
I am...

11:32.723 --> 11:33.747
Sis...

11:34.625 --> 11:38.026
I am not your sister, after all.

11:45.970 --> 11:47.335
Seki?

11:48.038 --> 11:49.005
Lord Kashin...

11:50.341 --> 11:52.969
What do you want, Seki?

11:54.044 --> 11:56.376
Please reconsider your actions.

11:56.447 --> 12:00.781
If you act against the wishes
of these people any further...

12:00.851 --> 12:03.752
...it is more than certain that
the Company will be decimated.

12:03.821 --> 12:05.584
What do you want to say?

12:06.056 --> 12:09.116
The young Wind User
and Chelsea Rorec...

12:09.660 --> 12:14.120
Is it really necessary to go this far
for just two people?

12:14.965 --> 12:17.695
It seems this is
too much of a sacrifice.

12:18.669 --> 12:21.001
Sacrifice?

12:27.545 --> 12:30.844
Compared to the sorrow
of having lost Sarasa...

12:30.915 --> 12:33.383
...this would hardly be
considered a sacrifice!

12:33.984 --> 12:34.814
However...!

12:37.021 --> 12:37.817
Seki!

12:40.157 --> 12:43.388
Are you going to
betray me as well?

12:52.002 --> 12:54.800
Are you going to
betray me as well?

12:55.639 --> 12:56.537
There!

12:56.740 --> 12:57.434
All right!

12:59.710 --> 13:00.870
It's time!

13:01.745 --> 13:04.270
I shall destroy the Killing Fields!

13:04.415 --> 13:05.973
Wind Storm!

13:12.857 --> 13:13.516
Ruri!

13:13.591 --> 13:14.353
Ruri!

13:14.592 --> 13:16.526
Chelsea! Rumina!

13:18.028 --> 13:21.555
Lord Kashin,
leave the Maiden to me!

13:24.068 --> 13:25.262
Rumina!

13:25.536 --> 13:27.629
Hold it! Hand over Ruri!

13:28.772 --> 13:30.262
Sarasa...

13:30.975 --> 13:33.500
Sarasa belongs to me!

13:33.944 --> 13:34.933
Kashin...

13:37.114 --> 13:40.379
Rumina Asagi, Chelsea Rorec...

13:40.684 --> 13:45.348
Now that you've seen Sarasa,
you can both die in peace.

13:46.156 --> 13:47.384
Now die!

13:56.467 --> 13:58.731
So, that's the power of wind, huh?

14:00.437 --> 14:01.369
Interesting.

14:05.142 --> 14:07.201
Wh-What?!
What is this power?!

14:11.549 --> 14:13.779
Wh-What are you doing,
Blondie?!

14:13.851 --> 14:16.649
Leave him to me
and go after Ruri!

14:16.720 --> 14:17.778
Don't be ridiculous!

14:18.055 --> 14:20.216
You can't fight him on your own!

14:20.291 --> 14:22.191
Chelsea Rorec...

14:23.327 --> 14:27.423
It's been a while since
I've seen the power of gravity.

14:28.766 --> 14:31.257
I'd like to have some fun.

14:40.110 --> 14:42.977
Let me remind you that
you're up against me!

14:44.682 --> 14:49.142
You mustn't underestimate
the leader of the Company.

14:49.286 --> 14:50.913
I don't underestimate you!

14:51.822 --> 14:54.086
I'll give you everything I've got!

14:56.961 --> 14:57.950
Everything?

14:58.295 --> 14:59.626
Is that it?

15:09.506 --> 15:10.404
Blondie!

15:10.808 --> 15:13.538
Good-bye, Chelsea Rorec!

15:19.016 --> 15:22.417
So, you're going to betray me.

15:24.555 --> 15:25.544
Seki...

15:30.527 --> 15:31.892
Crimson Fire!

15:34.131 --> 15:37.498
Wind User! You go after Pairon
and the Maiden of Life!

15:38.402 --> 15:40.802
Pairon intends to resurrect
the Dragons.

15:41.171 --> 15:43.162
Do everything you can
to stop him!

15:43.240 --> 15:45.071
The Dragons?!

15:45.609 --> 15:47.804
He needed Ruri for that?

15:48.045 --> 15:48.977
Hurry!

15:49.179 --> 15:50.339
I know you can do it!

15:50.781 --> 15:51.713
You...!

15:52.316 --> 15:53.544
Hurry up and go!

15:53.617 --> 15:54.641
All right!

16:02.793 --> 16:03.555
Kashin...

16:05.729 --> 16:09.529
I believed in the ideals
that you inspired.

16:09.700 --> 16:13.500
And I'm sure Chelsea
felt the same way.

16:14.571 --> 16:17.404
But you have changed.

16:17.474 --> 16:21.137
What happened to
the Kashin of our youth?

16:26.050 --> 16:28.211
Try to remember, Kashin.

16:28.419 --> 16:32.823
Remember the ideals, the passion,
and the spirit of those times.

16:32.823 --> 16:35.087
Try to remember!

16:36.794 --> 16:37.852
Kashin...

16:38.429 --> 16:39.396
Why?

16:39.897 --> 16:40.420
Huh?

16:43.067 --> 16:44.364
Why is it?

16:47.504 --> 16:50.701
Kill me. Kill me, Kashin.

16:51.208 --> 16:52.072
Kashin...

16:52.142 --> 16:53.769
No. No.

16:53.844 --> 16:55.744
No way!

16:56.580 --> 16:59.845
Why does everyone abandon me?

17:01.585 --> 17:02.483
I am...

17:03.420 --> 17:06.617
I am not your sister, after all.

17:14.398 --> 17:17.663
Traitors will have to die!

17:18.736 --> 17:23.696
That is the absolute
and final rule of the Company.

17:24.808 --> 17:29.142
I hope you have prepared
yourselves, you two!

17:34.651 --> 17:36.278
Please let me go!

17:36.353 --> 17:37.718
Please! Let me go!

17:38.856 --> 17:39.914
Let go!

17:41.158 --> 17:42.557
Shut up, you little wench!

17:42.760 --> 17:44.250
Don't you order me!

17:45.295 --> 17:48.822
If I wasn't around,
you would've been...

17:48.899 --> 17:49.866
Ruri!

17:50.601 --> 17:51.295
Rumina!

17:54.538 --> 17:55.505
Ruri!

17:55.572 --> 17:56.903
Rumina!

17:57.040 --> 17:58.166
Ruri!

18:01.278 --> 18:02.609
Why, you!

18:02.846 --> 18:04.370
Water Burst!

18:09.319 --> 18:10.479
Hold it!

18:11.922 --> 18:12.911
Damn!

18:15.526 --> 18:17.619
Wh-Where are we going?

18:18.028 --> 18:19.825
The Underglobe.

18:20.664 --> 18:22.359
The Underglobe?

18:22.766 --> 18:23.630
That's right.

18:24.368 --> 18:27.667
I have finally learned
the location of the Dragons.

18:38.348 --> 18:40.942
After this stadium is destroyed...

18:41.018 --> 18:43.350
...the altar for the resurrection
of the Dragons will appear!

18:45.222 --> 18:46.849
Maiden of Life...

18:47.191 --> 18:49.955
...you shall be sacrificed on that altar!

18:50.027 --> 18:51.289
How could you?!

18:51.395 --> 18:54.159
There're so many people in there!

18:55.666 --> 18:59.363
Even at a time like this,
you still think of others first?!

19:19.590 --> 19:21.683
It is now about to begin.

19:21.758 --> 19:24.056
The resurrection that follows
total destruction!

19:29.499 --> 19:30.557
Wh-What?!

19:30.868 --> 19:32.733
What's happening to the ceiling?!

19:39.176 --> 19:42.441
Does Kashin intend on destroying
this world?

19:42.512 --> 19:43.444
No way...

19:44.147 --> 19:45.637
We've got to hurry...

19:55.092 --> 19:59.188
The ceiling of the slums will crumble
from the explosives planted there.

20:00.097 --> 20:03.032
Next the pillars that support the ceiling
will give way.

20:04.001 --> 20:06.231
The people stranded in the slums...

20:06.303 --> 20:09.431
...have nowhere to escape to and
will be crushed by the ceiling!

20:11.008 --> 20:14.171
Along with the sound
of their hopeless cries.

20:14.544 --> 20:18.378
If you do that, you'll destroy
the entire Underground!

20:18.448 --> 20:20.746
What about it?

20:27.591 --> 20:31.288
A new beginning is upon us!

20:44.374 --> 20:49.277
Again, I walk the streets today

20:49.346 --> 20:55.285
As if I have a purpose

20:55.352 --> 21:07.492
Through a city that looks
polished beyond belief

21:08.465 --> 21:19.342
Are you crying?
Those of you with such tiny pasts

21:19.409 --> 21:30.843
When you look up,
you see the sky on a digital screen

21:31.722 --> 21:40.630
The song of the wind...
I climb up the long staircase

21:40.697 --> 21:44.360
I tried to listen

21:44.434 --> 21:52.500
Hold me
The dream that gently wounded me

21:52.576 --> 22:01.177
Has faded away
Please don't cry

22:10.360 --> 22:12.294
Preview

22:12.696 --> 22:14.823
The people of the Underground...

22:14.998 --> 22:16.363
The people of the surface...

22:16.767 --> 22:18.826
I don't want to hurt anyone
anymore.

22:19.369 --> 22:22.668
So Rumina, Chelsea...

22:22.739 --> 22:24.536
...Ginnosuke, Shiel...

22:24.941 --> 22:26.272
Please give me strength.

22:27.077 --> 22:29.545
I don't want to give up.

22:30.781 --> 22:32.408
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:32.482 --> 22:33.710
Final Episode...

22:34.084 --> 22:35.485
..."Toward the Light - United Ambitions".

22:35.485 --> 22:36.820
Toward the Light - United Ambitions
..."Toward the Light - United Ambitions".

22:36.820 --> 22:40.256
Toward the Light - United Ambitions
